<div id="p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix</span> is organized as follows:</p>
<ul id="A0.I1" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A0.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Theoretical Derivations ‣ Asynchronous Denoising Diffusion Models for Aligning Text-to-Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>:</span> provides the proof of the proposition in the main text and the formulation of the DDIM sampler.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A0.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Implementation Details ‣ Asynchronous Denoising Diffusion Models for Aligning Text-to-Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>:</span> provides more details on implementation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A0.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Pseudo-Code ‣ Asynchronous Denoising Diffusion Models for Aligning Text-to-Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>:</span> provides the pseudo-code of employing AsynDM to generate images.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A0.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D More Experimental Results ‣ Asynchronous Denoising Diffusion Models for Aligning Text-to-Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>:</span> presents more experimental results.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A0.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A0.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A0.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A0.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix <a href="#A5" title="Appendix E More Samples ‣ Asynchronous Denoising Diffusion Models for Aligning Text-to-Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a>:</span> presents more image samples generated by AsynDM.</p>
